    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.icons\n\n### Description\n\nFirst, great modules.\nSecond this is my first issue.\n\nRecently there has been a new xdg-user-dir, XDG_PROJECTS_DIR, the default is \"$HOME/Projects\"\n\nThere is no dedicated glyph for the Projects directory. An easy fix is to add \"Projects\" to directory_icons. I think a suitable glyph would be nf-md-folder_edit \"󰣞\"",
