        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This should now be resolved on the latest `main`. Although I didn't see the \"official\" standard updated (which I suspect is [this one](https://specifications.freedesktop.org/basedir/latest/)), it does seem to be a somewhat new convention in the process of being adopted.\n\nInterestingly enough, I went through possible candidates for the icon without remembering there was a suggestion here and the result appeared the same :)",
